<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Evergreen Media.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Evergreen Media.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it lowered its rating on Evergreen Media Corp to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/4 to 31-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
